5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate walking past the corner in August. It smells terrible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about the cost. Who pays for the new setup?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We need to keep talking to each other. The last row was awful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know how many hours this will take us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,One house has this at their gate. That feels unfair.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, if it takes too long, I will be annoyed.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, I agree. Fairness is important for the budget too.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the smell is bad, but the silence is worse.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, I need to see the time commitment before I agree.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, I want a plan that doesn't burden one person.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look at the ward subsidy and shelter costs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will read the station block's meeting minutes.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the ward complaint log for this point.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Also, I will check the truck arrival time from the crew leader.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,And I will check the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the statements at the residents' meeting.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
