35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The bin house smells worse than the open pile.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The subsidy is only forty percent. We pay the rest.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The minutes show they argued about sweeping within two years.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,Supervised mornings take fifty minutes. That is a lot.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Eleven complaints came from the gate household. That is heavy.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, fifty minutes is too long for me to stand there.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Asuka, that explains why they are so frustrated.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the enclosed option might be worse for smell.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, the ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen in extra fees.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, I worry about the social friction of a permanent build.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,The truck comes at seven forty. That is very early.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,The average shelter cost was two hundred forty-eight thousand yen.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Three people said they wouldn't turn away late bags.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,A permanent build needs four months and five signatures.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,One frontage is crossed by a driveway. That is a problem.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if we can't turn bags away, the window fails.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@May, four months is a long time to wait for a fix.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, the driveway issue makes rotating locations tricky.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Rin, the early truck time makes the window impossible.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Midori, the cost is high, but the complaint log is worse.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
